"""
AI Customer Support Copilot
===========================
Single-file system for Recruitbots AI — LLM Application Engineer Challenge 1.

Production-style support assistant that:
  • retrieves answers from a product knowledge base (RAG)
  • keeps chat history per conversation
  • returns structured JSON with citations
  • escalates when evidence is weak or the user asks for a human

Optional open-weight Llama polish via an OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
No fine-tuned models. Customer-facing text has no machine-origin labels.
"""

